ity (or an Electronic Record of the same) must be delivered in accordance with Article 12.21 before the time appointed for the taking of the poll;","section":"","block":1598,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-098529","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-10","reportDate":"2026-09-09","cik":"0001966750","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1966750/000121390026098529/ea030476301ex99-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c76875556f69c0e25f9f9f733f27c478cf6d57991f52b516fe0178448360805e.bin","sha256":"c76875556f69c0e25f9f9f733f27c478cf6d57991f52b516fe0178448360805e"}},{"id":"c79001580f1ace915e28e5728660d04615c4e01442c2c59acf5dee52d28000e3","quote":"14.1The first Directors shall be appointed in writing by the subscriber or subscribers to the Memorandum, or a majority of them.","context":"First Directors","section":"","block":1611,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-098529","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-10","reportDate":"2026-09-09","cik":"0001966750","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1966750/000121390026098529/ea030476301ex99-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c76875556f69c0e25f9f9f733f27c478cf6d57991f52b516fe0178448360805e.bin","sha256":"c76875556f69c0e25f9f9f733f27c478cf6d57991f52b516fe0178448360805e"}},{"id":"556ef59f9d5d4b0c63d5e88a398c5df7f2aeb50b9514e1f81580d08db05d3d46","quote":"14.5A Director may be appointed by Ordinary Resolution or by the Directors. Any appointment may be to fill a vacancy or as an additional Director.","context":"Appointment of Directors","section":"","block":1619,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-098529","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-10","reportDate":"2026-09-09","cik":"0001966750","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1966750/000121390026098529/ea030476301ex99-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c76875556f69c0e25f9f9f733f27c478cf6d57991f52b516fe0178448360805e.bin","sha256":"c76875556f69c0e25f9f9f733f27c478cf6d57991f52b516fe0178448360805e"}},{"id":"8c5ae2277df76bf9cfa915b39e2a51e74e33c4642be7dc59455385dbe36d9f7e","quote":"14.10Any Director so appointed shall, if still a Director, retire at the next annual general meeting after his appointment and be eligible to stand for election as a Director at such meeting.","context":"14.9Without prejudice to the Company’s power to appoint a person to be a Director pursuant to these Articles, the Board shall have power at any time to appoint any person who is willing to act as a Director, either to fill a vacancy or as an addition to the existing Board, subject to the total number of Directors not exceeding any maximum number fixed by or in accordance with these Articles.","section":"","block":1625,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-098529","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-10","reportDate":"2026-09-09","cik":"0001966750","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1966750/000121390026098529/ea030476301ex99-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c76875556f69c0e25f9f9f733f27c478cf6d57991f52b516fe0178448360805e.bin","sha256":"c76875556f69c0e25f9f9f733f27c478cf6d57991f52b516fe0178448360805e"}},{"id":"5d7d0eba943681e098c9cb4ac5601565252ead718441ffc4183928753c88ce08","quote":"14.11No person (other than a Director retiring in accordance with these Articles) shall be appointed or re-appointed a Director at any general meeting unless:","context":"Eligibility","section":"","block":1628,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-098529","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-10","reportDate":"2026-09-09","cik":"0001966750","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar